	"data": "Inventory — Shared Asset Catalog\n\nStatus: Specification  \nCreated: 2026-09-24  \nAuthor: Calcifer (from Chris's handwritten design doc)  \nHost: Optiplex (192.168.1.228 / 100.96.169.9)\nOverview\n\nInventory is a shared catalog database for all of Chris's physical and digital assets. It lives on Optiplex as a PostgreSQL database with a REST API, and any app can read from it. The core idea: one canonical list of things you own that multiple area-specific apps build on top of.\n\nA shirt in the closet,…",
